# Files srwr does not put on the tape (same format as .gitignore).
# Defaults that are never recorded: .env, .env.*, *.pem, *.key, id_rsa*,
# id_ed25519*, *.p12, *.pfx and anything in .srwr/.
# .mtqg/ is read and written only through the mtqg CLI (.claude/rules/mtqg-usage.md).
.mtqg/
# .bcuz/ is written only by bcuz (.claude/rules/bcuz-usage.md).
.bcuz/
# Build output and results (qsoku bin, qsoku dist, qsoku ui-check, the extension's compile and dependencies).
/bin/
/dist/
/ui-check-result/
extension/node_modules/
extension/out/
*.vsix
